  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 711.09 Monitoring for Asbestos. Asbestos monitoring shall be in accordance with Env-Dw 711.11 through Env-Dw 711.17, unless a waiver is obtained pursuant to Env-Dw 711.10.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
